    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="849d54fb-feae-5763-9c56-38b806c2ad67" activityNameId="c8be645a-0079-5ad0-aaf1-af540b374788" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Electricity mix, consumer, according to BFE 2005, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Electricity mix, consumer, according to BFE 2005, at plant
Electricity domestic net production and import shares are based on annual averages.;
UUID: c386d9c0-b050-3c17-a4a3-7f603b6e5d7c
It includes the shares of domestic electricity production by technology and imports from neighbouring countries (production mixes) at the busbar. It does not include transformation, transport nor distribution losses.
Location: Data apply to public and self producers in Switzerland. It includes imports from Germany, France, Italy, Austria and other countries (approximated with the CENTREL Mix).
Technology: No technology description is provided because the dataset just describes the power plant portfolio of the respective country using current (2004) average technology per energy carrier.
Time period: Time period of statistics used.
Production volume: production volume on low voltage level: 51'000GWh
Sampling: Statistical data 
Extrapolations: unknown electricity is modeled with UCTE-electricity mix
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_c386d9c0-b050-3c17-a4a3-7f603b6e5d7c.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
      <geography geographyId="fdab769f-4bdb-5024-8349-c1745bbb2597" geographyContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83">
        <shortname xml:lang="en">CH</shortname>
        <comment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Location: Data apply to public and self producers in Switzerland. It includes imports from Germany, France, Italy, Austria and other countries (approximated with the CENTREL Mix).</text>
